      "previewDescription": "I no longer try to dissuade her.",
      "startdescription": "The girl kneels beside the stretcher. She blows out the lamp. In the darkness, she presses her palms to the wounded person's forehead and temples. Once he calms, her fingers dance over the wound. Threading the needle, blood flows from one side and stops at the other. Soon, the wounded person opens his eyes.",
