    {
      "id": "communicate.tomoriserpent.friend.yuri",
      "actionid": "communicate",
      "label": "Befriend: Warrant Officer Yuri Shereenko",
      "previewDescription": "I brought her to Yuri to 'register,' as every new soldier must do.",
      "startdescription": "The girl stands before Yuri. She does not dare speak. Yuri keeps frowning. The two just stand there awkwardly. Finally Yuri asks first: 'Do you have a belief you will uphold for life and never betray? Have you held a gun? Do you dare pull the trigger on a person? Has your hand been stained with the blood of war?' The girl is almost frightened: 'I... do not know...' Yuri's mouth keeps twitching, extreme disappointment and coldness hidden in his eyes. I promptly pull the girl out. Later, Yuri spends several days preparing a red notebook and luggage for the girl. 'The battlefield is not merciful.'",
      "extantreqs": {
        "talkwithtomoriserpent": 1
      },
      "requirements": {
        "haspolevaya": 1,
        "friend": 2,
        "friend.yuri": 1,
        "exhausted": -1,
        "wounded": -1
      },
